# The page's own derived output never lands here: the built `graph.html` goes to the module's
# `.jcodebuddy/metadata/hipster-ioc/` (DEC-026), and the bundle stages inside the jsx6 checkout's
# `.tmp/`. What this file guards is the case of someone running `bun install` here — the jsx6 packages
# resolve through the checkout, so nothing under `node_modules` is ever a source of truth for this page.
node_modules/
.tmp/
